data: {"id": "d0a761dae5bb4438-thinking-parallel_evidence-1190", "run_id": "d0a761dae5bb4438", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 根因证据结论\n\n### 支持的因果事实\n\n1. **Pod 生命周期状态**：`workload` (UID `00e5e755-...`) 当前处于 `Running` 阶段，但容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting (CrashLoopBackOff)`，`Restart Count: 5`，节点 `node2`。\n2. **终止原因 (Last State)**：上次容器终止 `Reason: Error`，**Exit Code 127**，`Started` 和 `Finished` 时间戳完全一致（瞬间退出）。\n3. **命令配置 (kubectl get -o yaml)**：`Command: [\"sh\", \"-c\", \"exec /opt/app/unavailable-command\"]`。\n4. **日志原文 (ES)**：5 条重复日志，核心信息为 `sh: exec: line 0: /opt/app/unavailable-command: not found`。\n5. **Topology**：确认 Pod 属于 `aiops-case-v08` ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789132091524, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

